Sun Nov 15 20:05:06 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- strip the payload update manifest: resources/build.json carries
  HFInstall=deb, which arms the app's own updater (debInstall.mjs runs
  /usr/bin/apt-get through pkexec on the Debian targets and would
  replace this package with the upstream .deb). The asar reads that
  file and bails with "no build commit" when it is absent, so removing
  it disables the in-app updater the same way the app-update.yml strip
  does everywhere else

